WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.202 --> 00:00:04.945
(suspenseful music)

00:00:07.519 --> 00:00:07.931
- I don't know,

00:00:07.931 --> 00:00:11.333
we don't spend a whole
bunch of time holding hands.

00:00:11.333 --> 00:00:12.708
- Stop makin' excuses.

00:00:12.708 --> 00:00:17.519
("Echoes of Tension" by
Warner/Chappell Production Music)

00:00:18.756 --> 00:00:20.400
- Okay, got it.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:21.750
It's already the hardest part.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.204
Yeah, I'm gonna have to wait to compare,

00:00:23.204 --> 00:00:25.750
but I feel like this
hand might be too small.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.511
Um, this is so nerve-racking!

00:00:29.255 --> 00:00:30.787
Oh, this is so hard.

00:00:32.078 --> 00:00:33.049
Now, I'm like Goldilocks.

00:00:33.049 --> 00:00:35.975
I feel like this hand might
be a little too big. (laughs)

00:00:37.685 --> 00:00:39.378
Could be, could be Matt?

00:00:45.294 --> 00:00:48.133
This hand is definitely
colder than the other hands.

00:00:49.324 --> 00:00:51.241
That's my first observation,

00:00:51.241 --> 00:00:54.218
so that makes me feel
like it could not be him,

00:00:54.218 --> 00:00:55.232
but I don't know.

00:00:55.232 --> 00:00:57.199
The size feels right on this one.

00:00:58.129 --> 00:01:00.721
It's equally as soft as the other,

00:01:00.721 --> 00:01:02.979
everyone's had really soft hands today.

00:01:02.979 --> 00:01:05.603
Yeah, okay, I think I'm ready to guess.

00:01:05.603 --> 00:01:09.954
I think Matt is hand number three.

00:01:11.030 --> 00:01:12.182
(laughs)

00:01:12.182 --> 00:01:13.629
- You got it! (laughs)

00:01:13.629 --> 00:01:15.655
- Yay!

00:01:15.655 --> 00:01:16.586
- Well done, babe.

00:01:16.586 --> 00:01:17.813
(both laughing)

00:01:17.813 --> 00:01:19.340
I was nervous there for a second.

00:01:19.340 --> 00:01:21.727
- I thought I was a horrible boyfriend.

00:01:21.727 --> 00:01:23.477
- It would have been okay
if he had gotten it wrong.

00:01:23.477 --> 00:01:25.191
- I would have made dinner
or something, I think.

00:01:25.191 --> 00:01:25.750
- Yeah!

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:28.349
- When I felt hand three, I knew.

00:01:28.349 --> 00:01:29.642
- I don't know if I could have done it.

00:01:29.642 --> 00:01:32.932
I mean, his fingers kind
of give it away, but...

00:01:33.772 --> 00:01:35.329
- My spindly alien fingers?
- [Matt] (laughing) Yeah!

00:01:35.329 --> 00:01:37.222
Your alien face fingers.

